SFX: Dial tone. 
ARIA: Hinadear, help me with this zipper.
HINA: Did you even try to put it on?
HINA: The dress is still on the floor.
ARIA: Thanks in advance.
HINA: …
ARIA: Oh?
HINA: …
ARIA: I do like it when you remind me how dangerous you are.
HINA: Mm.
HINA: I don’t think that deters you either way.
HINA: You’re a reckless woman.
ARIA: Is there any other way to live when you are destined to die a beautiful death?
ARIA: Is there anything better than your claws at the small of my back?
ARIA: I love dancing in the palm of your hand.
ARIA: As much as I love to see you at my beck and call.
HINA: …
HINA: Then, you understand.
ARIA: I know that you do not belong to me.
ARIA: But I will happily delude myself into thinking that I’ve found a way to put lightning in a bottle.
HINA: Heh.
HINA: Then, my lady. 
HINA: I hope you don’t mind the intrusion.
ARIA: ~
ARIA: ~~
ARIA: What a blackheart, my Hina.
;sfx click
